# The build context is agents/coding/. Two things must never enter the image:
#
#   .env         the coding agent's credentials. The sandbox gets nothing.
#   node_modules the host's install, ~200 MB, and platform-specific binaries
#                built for Windows. The image runs `npm ci` from the lockfile
#                instead, so shipping this would be both slow and wrong.
.env
vendor/node_modules/
vendor/.env-mask-empty
__pycache__/
